  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.34 - AM021/AM022 analyzer health calibration\n\n            Changed:\n            - Analyzer health audit now scores AM021 Tests at 5, matching AM022 under the same rubric\n            - Audit evidence records AM021's 29 analyzer test methods and 20 code-fix test methods against AM022's 29 analyzer and 16 code-fix methods\n            - The resolved P3 backlog entry documents the calibration in analyzer-health.md\n\n            Validation:\n            - Full solution test suite passing on net10.0 (824 tests)\n            - Rule catalog and sample diagnostics snapshot checks passing\n            - GitHub PR checks passing\n            - git diff --check clean\n\n            Previous Release: v2.30.33 - AM003 immutable/frozen container conversions",
